1
00:01:43,610 --> 00:01:47,750
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:50,950
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:51,920
Don't believe him. Don't believe him.

4
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,670
Let go. Let go.

5
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:53,400
Let go.

6
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:53,870
Three.

7
00:01:53,870 --> 00:01:56,070
-I'm here to make a serious offer!
-Two.

8
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,070
You want to invest in us?

9
00:02:05,070 --> 00:02:06,070
The money's yours anyway.

10
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:07,530
Spend it however you want.

11
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,509
Just... just...

12
00:02:09,509 --> 00:02:10,620
Just take it first.

13
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,329
Welcome aboard.

14
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,310
You believe me now?

15
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,120
Yes.

16
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:23,710
You won't make me do any dirty
or backbreaking work, right?

17
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:24,470
How could we?

18
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,200
We're all the good guys here.

19
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,000
I love you guys!

20
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:29,630
I love you guys...

21
00:02:29,630 --> 00:02:31,310
Welcome, welcome.

22
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,490
A warm welcome. Let's welcome him.

23
00:02:35,290 --> 00:02:36,470
Eat while it's hot, bosses.

24
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:38,400
These are all my signature dishes.

25
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,860
Thanks for your hard work.

26
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:40,910
Eat with us.

27
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,420
I'm not hungry.

28
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,900
Don't say you're not hungry.
Eat with us.

29
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:46,800
How could I

30
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,430
sit down and eat with you?

31
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,560
Give it a taste.
See if the seasoning's right.

32
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,360
Go on, have a taste.

33
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,280
Come on, try them one by one.

34
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,540
What if it's too salty?

35
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,870
Pretty good, huh?

36
00:02:58,870 --> 00:02:59,520
You try

37
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,050
that one.

38
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,020
Fish balls.

39
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:07,300
You don't need to eat the shrimp.

40
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,470
That's enough.

41
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,470
-Save some for us.
-Save some for us.

42
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:11,520
That's enough.

43
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,630
Don't spit it out.

44
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,290
Swallow it.

45
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:19,600
Are you okay?

46
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,800
-I'm full.
-You're full?

47
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,310
All right, get back to work.

48
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:23,240
I'm gonna hit the bathroom.

49
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,700
Thanks for your hard work.

50
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:28,960
That's great.

51
00:03:29,150 --> 00:03:30,960
It should be fine. Let's eat.

52
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,150
A hundred bills.

53
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:43,520
They are real.

54
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,520
They are all real. They are all real.

55
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,320
They are real.

56
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:47,280
My father was right after all.

57
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,940
Even a lost little lamb

58
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:51,530
can still be a good one

59
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,710
if you feed it with kindness—

60
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,590
from my father's handwriting,

61
00:03:55,590 --> 00:03:57,430
page 57, line 2.

62
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:59,350
But don't be too optimistic.

63
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:01,750
I don't think it's that simple.

64
00:04:01,750 --> 00:04:03,430
After all my years
in the entertainment business,

65
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:05,470
I think he's a bit weird.

66
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,710
Who cares if he's up to something?

67
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,800
He gave us the money

68
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,940
and wants to help us work.

69
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:11,070
Let him work for now.

70
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,470
-Yes.
-Let's just keep a close eye on him.

71
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:12,960
Yes.

72
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,680
Let's eat.

73
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:14,120
Eat.

74
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,230
Come here!

75
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,720
-Junnan.
-Come here.

76
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,040
Hey, Junnan.

77
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,100
Don't call me that.

78
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,070
Who are you calling that?

79
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,190
What were you doing?

80
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:22,720
What were you stealing in the bathroom?

81
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,190
What could I steal from a bathroom?

82
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,430
Shit. What else?

83
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:25,800
I steal...

84
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,750
It... it stinks.

85
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:27,830
Get out. Get out. Get out.

86
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,000
Let him out first.

87
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,050
Look how bad this guy is.

88
00:04:34,490 --> 00:04:35,850
He even steals shit.

89
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,370
He must be starving.

90
00:04:37,430 --> 00:04:38,120
Junnan.

91
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:40,120
You don't understand the situation.

92
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,680
He's on our side now.

93
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:43,490
What?

94
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,050
He fell out with Gao Jiaoqi.

95
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:46,830
How is that possible?

96
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:49,950
Let me put it this way.

97
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:52,640
Even if Erkang and Ziwei
had a falling-out,

98
00:04:52,659 --> 00:04:54,090
they could never
really turn on each other.

99
00:04:54,090 --> 00:04:56,150
Didn't you see how badly he was beaten?

100
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:57,630
Isn't this just the old "suffering
to win sympathy" trick?

101
00:04:57,630 --> 00:05:00,040
I used to be a top-tier villain.

102
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,020
I know what he's thinking.

103
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,750
What good intentions could he have?

104
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:05,510
He even cooked us a whole spread.

105
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,160
Yeah, look.

106
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:06,600
Ximei!

107
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:07,920
Stop.

108
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,780
Who knows what he put in there?

109
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,770
Silly Qiang.

110
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:17,310
From now on, I, Chen Junnan,

111
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:20,270
will cover all your food and drinks.

112
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,890
Only instant noodles?

113
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,770
There's more outside.

114
00:05:24,770 --> 00:05:26,240
I'll bring it in later, Ximei.

115
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,750
Thanks.

116
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:29,070
Don't mention it.

117
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,750
I don't think we need to worry

118
00:05:32,770 --> 00:05:33,830
too much about Fei.

119
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:34,920
From now on,

120
00:05:35,190 --> 00:05:36,720
I'll keep a close eye on him.

121
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:38,240
Problem solved.

122
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:38,720
You?

123
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:39,200
Okay.

124
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:41,010
I'll take it as a chance

125
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:42,610
to make up for my mistakes.

126
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,560
Ximei.

127
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,620
I'll accompany you

128
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,400
to keep an eye on him.

129
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,560
You want to keep an eye on him, too?

130
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,150
Great.

131
00:05:51,150 --> 00:05:53,040
Then you watch him, so I don't have to.

132
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,680
Thanks.

133
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,710
-Let's eat.
-Come on.

134
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,650
Keep him under tight watch.

135
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:02,630
Keep him under tight watch for me!

136
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:05,290
I have to say,
the food Fei cooked is pretty good.

137
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,950
Actually, now,

138
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,120
I've completely turned over a new leaf.

139
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,600
I've completely
broken ties with Gao Jiaoqi.

140
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,070
So,

141
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:21,070
you don't need to watch
me like this, do you?

142
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:27,400
Do you think I'll buy that?

143
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:28,980
Let me tell you.

144
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:32,560
Tonight, I'm the biggest bug in Shapu.

145
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,130
What does that mean?

146
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,350
I've got my eyes glued to you.

147
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,150
Coffee.

148
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,980
Red Bull.

149
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:42,950
Screwdriver.

150
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,110
Go sleep.

151
00:06:58,300 --> 00:06:59,100
I can't sleep.

152
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:05,680
Give it to me.

153
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:07,440
Why are you taking my phone?

154
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,700
Who knows what you're going to do with it?

155
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:17,660
Come on, perform for me.

156
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,400
Why?

157
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:20,080
I'm sleepy.

158
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,160
You're sleepy.

159
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,190
You're sleepy?
You've brought so much stuff with you.

160
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:23,000
Just drink coffee

161
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,240
or stab yourself in the leg.

162
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,070
You talk too much.

163
00:07:25,070 --> 00:07:26,400
Come on, perform for me.

164
00:07:26,770 --> 00:07:28,440
Look, if you're sleepy, just go to sleep.

165
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,150
You sleep first.

166
00:07:29,150 --> 00:07:30,050
I can't sleep.

167
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,510
How can I sleep if you don't?

168
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,150
Why?

169
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:32,920
What do you mean, why?

170
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,390
Let me tell you.

171
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,040
There's no way I'm sleeping tonight.

172
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,000
I won't sleep.

173
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,040
I'll keep my eyes on you all night.

174
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,500
I'll watch you like a hawk.

175
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:27,320
How can you watch anyone like this?

176
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:54,730
This ragtag bunch,

177
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,480
this amateur operation,

178
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,270
these clowns,

179
00:08:59,090 --> 00:09:00,170
these small fry,

180
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,130
actually started filming.

181
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:03,720
No.

182
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:04,440
Jiaoqi,

183
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,270
we have to stop their filming kickoff.

184
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:07,080
You go.

185
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:09,750
Wait,

186
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:11,270
aren't you going?

187
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:12,480
How can I go?

188
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,150
I've got such a bad reputation now.

189
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:17,110
They'll beat me up
the second I set foot in the village.

190
00:09:17,110 --> 00:09:19,240
The point is, Chen Junnan betrayed us.

191
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,600
Jiaoqi, haven't you been reading

192
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,550
"Romance of the Three Kingdoms"?

193
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:27,510
How far have you gotten?

194
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,440
Got any ideas?

195
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,170
I've read the Battle of Red Cliffs,

196
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,270
Jiang Gan Stealing the Letter,

197
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:36,270
Borrowing Arrows with Straw Boats,

198
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:37,990
Huang Gai's Fake Surrender,

199
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:40,130
and the Burning of the Red Cliffs.

200
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:42,270
-Burning of the Red Cliffs!
-Huang Gai's Fake Surrender.

201
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:43,670
You mean set them on fire?

202
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:45,000
Fake surrender.

203
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,470
Bombing poop?

204
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,930
That's so unhygienic.

205
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,550
Especially since all the toilets
in their village are outhouses.

206
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:53,390
The "surrender" kind of "Xiang."

207
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,240
If you'd just finished middle school,

208
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,570
talking to you wouldn't be so exhausting.

209
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:58,440
Basically, fake surrender means

210
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,720
we pretend to fall out,

211
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:02,550
you pretend to defect to their side,

212
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,830
and bring them down from within.

213
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,720
Jiaoqi, I can't be an undercover agent.

214
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,270
I'm not Chen Yongren.

215
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:10,160
You are the best candidate.

216
00:10:10,350 --> 00:10:12,430
You'll participate
in the filming of this movie

217
00:10:12,430 --> 00:10:14,020
and make sure you're in every scene,

218
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:15,480
100% Fei, 100% of the time.

219
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,200
You're gonna make me a star.

220
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,840
I'll build you up into a star,

221
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:20,520
then engineer a scandal

222
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:22,180
that brings you crashing down.

223
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:23,810
And because you're in every scene,

224
00:10:23,810 --> 00:10:25,070
they won't be able to edit you out,

225
00:10:25,070 --> 00:10:26,730
and this movie will be ruined.

226
00:10:28,010 --> 00:10:28,940
That's brutal,

227
00:10:28,970 --> 00:10:29,510
Jiaoqi.

228
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,440
I'm calling this plan

229
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:33,200
Operation Rat Poop.

230
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,780
One piece of rat poop
can ruin the whole pot of porridge.

231
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:40,750
So I'll be that important piece
of rat poop.

232
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:45,140
So how do I get into the pot?

233
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:49,010
Give them money. I've decided

234
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,960
I'll use all my savings

235
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,320
plus my secret stash.

236
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:55,360
Don't tell your sister.

237
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,770
Jiaoqi, you're getting me all fired up.

238
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,440
I'm even a little excited.

239
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,390
I am Chen Yongren.

240
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,390
I am Chen Yongren.

241
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:03,510
I am Chen Yongren.

242
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,030
Jiaoqi, do you...

243
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:06,690
do you want to eat pistachios?

244
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,670
You ready?

245
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,290
Ready.

246
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,970
Why are you taking off your watch?

247
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:12,050
For Huang Gai's Fake Surrender,

248
00:11:12,050 --> 00:11:13,930
the key is to earn their trust.

249
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,240
Zhou Yu first had Huang Gai...

250
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,670
No, we don't need to do this, do we?

251
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:19,600
Jiaoqi!

252
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:21,120
My glasses. Jiaoqi!

253
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:21,920
It hurts!

254
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,240
Jiaoqi.

255
00:11:25,550 --> 00:11:27,000
Jiaoqi, Jiaoqi, it's me.

256
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,200
Are you crazy?

257
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,600
Didn't I say to text me
if you need anything?

258
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,480
A phone call could blow

259
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,360
your cover.

260
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,150
It's fine.

261
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:35,240
Chen Junnan sleeps like a log.

262
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:37,050
He's a pretty heavy sleeper.

263
00:11:37,050 --> 00:11:38,180
What is it? Hurry up.

264
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,080
Jiaoqi, I want to tell you

265
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,960
that since I got here,

266
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:46,520
everything is going smoothly.

267
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:47,960
Wait, is that it?

268
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:48,910
No,

269
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,250
I also wanted to ask

270
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,770
about that job for my aunt.

271
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:56,650
When do you think you
can set her up with it?

272
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,640
How about I make her
Mr. Huang's secretary?

273
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,570
Aren't you Mr. Huang's secretary?

274
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,030
She'll be the second secretary.

275
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:05,200
That's good.

276
00:12:05,570 --> 00:12:06,050
Well...

277
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:08,510
Okay, Jiaoqi, get some sleep.

278
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:09,400
By the way...

279
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,770
T-The place you're staying

280
00:12:11,770 --> 00:12:16,030
isn't exactly clean. ("Not clean"
is a euphemism for a place being haunted.)

281
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,560
W-What do you mean not clean?

282
